      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The experience of an impostor suddenly appearing in front of you as a garbled mess can be extremely jarring, and it would be super beneficial for world creators to be able to force fallbacks instead of impostors to better enable the use of these effects. Even the ability to disable all impostors as a user would be appreciated, but IMO the proposal outlined here is the ideal solution for world creators.",
